cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "tavp: a task-aware validation protocol for generative models of financial time series"
abstract: >-
  Validation protocol that judges a generator of financial time series by a declared use:
  the induced laws of the metrics of calibrated decision rules are tested for equivalence
  with those of a known reference law within economic tolerances, with a statistical
  diagnosis, a test of the choice of the rule and a calibration test on market data. The
  repository validates the protocol with known-answer tests, applies it to the Time-Causal
  VAE and the Quant GAN, and reproduces every number, table and figure of the thesis chapter.
authors:
  - family-names: Palmacci
    given-names: Luca
    affiliation: "Sapienza University of Rome"
keywords:
  - generative models
  - financial time series
  - validation
  - backtesting
  - equivalence testing
version: 0.1.0
